{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RiftGuard</strong> is a roguelike action game with survival and resource management elements, set in a dark and mysterious world. <br>Take control of a hero who <strong>automatically attacks enemies</strong> while you focus on <strong>choosing upgrades, planning your strategy, and managing resources</strong> to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 distinct enemy types, each with unique patterns and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game time tracker to monitor your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A health indicator for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A coin counter that increases as you defeat enemies, used to unlock and upgrade abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A blood counter, which also serves as the <strong>score</strong> for each run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>9 unique abilities</strong>, each with <strong>3 to 4 upgrade levels</strong>, allowing for powerful combinations tailored to your playstyle. <br>Make every choice count, adapt to the chaos, and fight to survive for as long as you can.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752220?t=1749121576","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752220?t=1749121576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752220/2ebd2c687dacfd2797c00a279192bde4860bd510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749121576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752220/2ebd2c687dacfd2797c00a279192bde4860bd510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749121576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p